  "coreIdeas": [
    "Anurupyena means 'proportionally' — scale each part of the number separately.",
    "Multiply the multiplier with hundreds, then tens, then units.",
    "Add the three results in position: thousands, hundreds, tens, units.",
    "This avoids carry confusion by handling each digit independently."
  ],
